div class=\"gwt-Label multi-language-content content-en\" style=\"display: none;\">Shares Transaction Information</div></td><td align=\"left\" style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><div class=\"fa fa-question-circle fa-2x taxonomy-field-documentation  multi-language-content content-tr\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"></div></td><td align=\"left\" style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><div class=\"fa fa-question-circle fa-2x taxonomy-field-documentation  multi-language-content content-en\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display: none;\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td class=\"taxonomy-table-black-cell\"></td><td class=\"taxonomy-table-black-cell\"></td></tr><tr class=\"oda-10400_Shares-Transaction-Notification-row-10 abstract-row\"><td class=\"taxonomy-field-name-cell\"><div class=\"gwt-Label taxonomy-field-name\">oda_ExplanationSection|</div></td><td class=\"taxonomy-dimensional-context-cell\"></td><td class=\"taxonomy-field-title\"><table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" class=\"taxonomy-title-panel taxonomy-abstract-title standardLabel\"><tbody class=\"tbdy-1\"><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><div class=\"gwt-HTML\"><span class=\"space\"> </span></div></td><td align=\"left\" style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><div class=\"gwt-Label multi-language-content content-tr\" style=\"display: block;\">Açıklamalar</div></td><td align=\"left\" style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><div class=\"gwt-Label multi-language-content content-en\" style=\"display: none;\">Explanations</div></td><td align=\"left\" style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><div class=\"fa fa-question-circle fa-2x taxonomy-field-documentation  multi-language-content content-tr\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"></div></td><td align=\"left\" style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><div class=\"fa fa-question-circle fa-2x taxonomy-field-documentation  multi-language-content content-en\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display: none;\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table></td><td class=\"taxonomy-table-black-cell\"></td><td class=\"taxonomy-table-black-cell\"></td></tr><tr class=\"oda-10400_Shares-Transaction-Notification-row-11 data-input-row alternate-row presentation-enabled\"><td class=\"taxonomy-field-name-cell\"><div class=\"gwt-Label taxonomy-field-name\">oda_ExplanationTextBlock|</div></td><td class=\"taxonomy-dimensional-context-cell\"></td><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"taxonomy-context-value-summernote multi-language-content content-tr\" style=\"display: table-cell;\"><div><div><div class=\"text-block-value\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"fontsize:11.0pt;lineheight:115%;fontfamily:&#160;'Times New Roman',serif\">27.10.2026 tarihinde Metro Ticari ve Mali Yatırımlar&#160;Holding A.Ş. (METRO) payları ile ilgili olarak 7,52-7,60 TL fiyat aralığından&#160;750.000-TL toplam nominal tutarlı Satım işlemi ortaklığımızca&#160;gerçekleştirilmiştir.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"fontfamily: 'Times New Roman', serif; fontsize: 11pt; lineheight: 115%;\">Bu işlemle birlikte Metro Ticari ve Mali Yatırımlar Holding A.Ş. (METRO)&#160;sermayesindeki paylarımız 27.10.2026 tarihi itibariyle % 1,01 olmuştur.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"fontfamily: 'Times New Roman', serif; fontsize: 11pt; lineheight: 115%;\">Kamuoyuna duyurulur.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"fontfamily: 'Times New Roman', serif; fontsize: 11pt; lineheight: 115%;\">Saygılarımızla.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"fontsize: 11pt; lineheight: 115%; textalign: justify;\"><br/></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"fontsize: 11pt; lineheight: 115%; textalign: justify;\">Bu açıklamamızın&#160;İngilizce çevirisi eş anlı kamuya&#160;açıklanmış olup, açıklama metinlerinde&#160;herhangi bir farklılık olması&#160;durumunda Türkçe açıklama esas kabul edilecektir.</span><br/></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"fontsize:11.0pt;lineheight:115%;fontfamily:&#160;'Times New Roman',serif\"><p><br/></p></span></p></div></div></div></td><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"taxonomy-context-value-summernote multi-language-content content-en\" style=\"display: none;\"><div><div><div class=\"text-block-value\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"fontsize:11.0pt;lineheight:115%;fontfamily:&#160;'Times New Roman',serif\">On 27.10.2026, our Company sold shares of Metro Ticari&#160;ve Mali Yatırımlar Holding A.Ş. (METRO) with a total nominal value of TRY&#160;750,000, at prices ranging from TRY 7.52 to TRY 7.60 per share.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"fontfamily: 'Times New Roman', serif; fontsize: 11pt; lineheight: 115%;\">Following this transaction, our shareholding in the&#160;capital of Metro Ticari ve Mali Yatırımlar Holding A.Ş. (METRO) stood at 1.01%&#160;as of 27.10.2026.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"fontfamily: 'Times New Roman', serif; fontsize: 11pt; lineheight: 115%;\">This announcement is made to the public.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"fontfamily: 'Times New Roman', serif; fontsize: 11pt; lineheight: 115%;\">Yours sincerely,</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"fontsize:11.0pt;lineheight:115%;fontfamily:&#160;'Times New Roman',serif\"><p><br/></p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"fontsize: 11pt; lineheight: 115%; textalign: justify;\">This statement has been translated into English and&#160;simultaneously announced for informational purposes. In the event of any&#160;discrepancy between the Turkish and the English versions, the Turkish version&#160;shall prevail.</span><br/></p></div></div></div></td></tr></tbody><tbody class=\"\"><tr><td colspan=\"21\" class=\"taxonomy-title-panel taxonomy-abstract-title\"><div class=\"gwt-HTML\"><br/><br/><br/></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"21\" class=\"taxonomy-title-panel taxonomy-abstract-title\"><div><div class=\"gwt-Label multi-language-content content-tr\" style=\"display: block;\">Pay Alım Satım Bilgileri</div><div class=\"gwt-Label multi-language-content content-en\" s